# Local runtime and user data are never committed.
**/.venv/
**/node_modules/
**/data/
**/dist/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.packages/
**/.build-home/
**/staged/
**/__pycache__/
**/test-results/
*.pyc
*.log
*.db
*.pdf
*.zip
*.lnk
*.pid
*.png
*.json.tmp-*

# Keep the authored project, plans, and reusable verification scripts.
/outputs/*
!/outputs/paper-reader/
!/outputs/*.md
!/outputs/paperloop-interaction-design.html
/outputs/MonkeyOCR-双语阅读稿.md
/outputs/PaperLoop-阅读报告.md
/work/*
!/work/*.py
!/work/*.mjs
!/work/*.md
/work/PaperLoop-AgentLoop-真实研究报告.md
/work/monkeyocrv2-core-readonly.py

# Generated reports and local run records remain on this computer.
/work/*-result.json
/work/*-run-id.txt
/work/*-document.json
